Description:

274aafae2dd6bd04620641665f0aa030  libsys.so
669fefc61c350995093170ec35f3311c  libsys_version

- The original file `libsys.so.13.0.30.0.0.2` is split into `libsys.so` (main library) and `libsys_version` (version info).
- Both files are copied to the device only if the MD5 checksum does not match.
